      "name": "Caffeine, 3 mg/kg (about 300 mg) 45 minutes before the VO2 session",
      "note": "The best-evidenced performance aid there is (IOC 2018). Not after noon if sleep matters, and it drops heart rate 3 to 7 bpm at easy intensity, so the Zone 1 ceiling reads low on coffee."
