      "key": "creatine",
      "name": "Creatine monohydrate, 3 to 5 g a day",
      "note": "IOC strong evidence; helps masters hold muscle in a deficit. Adds 1 to 2 kg of water weight in the first weeks, so the scale box will jump."
    },
